  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nConsider A and C as '+'\n\nConsider B as '×'\n\nSo,\n\n13 A 14 B 15 C 20 = 243 ⇒ 13 + 14 × 15 + 20 = 243\n\n⇒ 13 + __**14 × 15**__ + 20 = 243\n\n⇒ __13 + 210 + 20__ = 243\n\n⇒ 243 = 243 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n15 A 10 B 8 C 9 = 104 ⇒ 15 + 10 × 8 + 9 = 104\n\n ⇒ 15 + __**10 ×**____** 8**__ + 9 = 104\n\n⇒ __15 + 80 + 9__ = 104\n\n⇒ 104 = 104 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n45 A 10 B 18 C 50 = ? ⇒ 45 + 10 × 18 + 50 = ?\n\n⇒ 45 + __**10 **____**×**____** 18**__ + 50 = ?\n\n⇒ __**45 + 180**____** + 50**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **275 **\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
